  "description": "Construction of a part two storey part single storey rear extension, a single storey side extension, a hip-to-gable roof extension to accommodate a rear dormer extension including three roof lights to the front&nbsp;to facilitate the conversion of roof space into\r\nhabitable accommodation&nbsp;and a single storey outbuilding&nbsp;",
  "appeal_decision": null,
  "postcode": "RM10 8NB",
  "date_building_work_completed_under_previous_permission": null,
  "decision_target_date": "21/02/2025",
  "street_name": "HOLGATE ROAD",
